# dist/ is committed: it is the small viewer the iguana binary embeds (heavy
# libraries load from a CDN at runtime, so it stays small). Rebuild it with
# `cargo xtask viewer` after changing web-viewer/.
#
# The wasm bundle is produced by `iguana generate --wasm` (here, copied from
# target/wasm/iggy) and dropped in alongside the viewer; it is not source.
public/manifest.json
public/wasm/
